    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Redefine is a 24-hour designathon that challenges you to question the way digital products work and <strong>reimagine familiar experiences from the ground up</strong>.</p>\n<p>Choose a platform, identify what can be challenged or improved, and transform your ideas into a compelling digital experience through <strong>UI/UX and visual design</strong>. Whether it is a radical redesign of an existing product or an entirely new interaction model, the goal is to think beyond conventional design.</p>\n<p><strong>What to Expect</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Round 0:</strong> Track and platform selection</li>\n<li><strong>Round 1:</strong> Design development begins</li>\n<li><strong>Review 1:</strong> Expert feedback</li>\n<li><strong>Round 2:</strong> Continue designing and refining</li>\n<li><strong>Review 2:</strong> Expert feedback</li>\n<li><strong>Round 3:</strong> Final development and refinement</li>\n<li><strong>Review 3:</strong> Final evaluation and shortlisting</li>\n<li><strong>Final Pitch:</strong> Present your solution to the judging panel</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Reviews are intended to provide feedback and guidance, while shortlisted teams advance to the final pitch.</p>\n<p><strong>Focus Areas</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>UI/UX Design</li>\n<li>Visual Design</li>\n<li>Interaction Design</li>\n<li>Digital Product Design</li>\n<li>Creative Problem Solving</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Other Details:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Date:</strong> 16&ndash;17 September 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> 24 Hours</li>\n<li><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">Team Size:</strong> 1-4 members</li>\n<li><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">Eligibility:</strong> Open to Everyone</li>\n<li><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">Registration Fee:</strong> ₹177</li>\n<li>You can complete the payment here after registering on Unstop: <a href=\"http://gravitas.vit.ac.in/events/d440eb17-cc8b-4651-943a-1d449a2efeee\">gravitas.vit.ac.in/events/d440eb17-cc8b-4651-943a-1d449a2efeee</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Take something familiar. Question everything about it. <strong>Redefine it.</strong></p>",
